# Parallax Wave: "When this enchantment leaves the battlefield, each player returns to the battlefield all cards they
# own exiled with it." Bot1 exiles Bot2's Llanowar Elves with the Wave on turn three, then bounces the Wave itself with
# Paradoxical Outcome (Mox Sapphire, Sol Ring and Mox Ruby paying), and the Elves come back under Bot2's control.

